A||||6||Rodney||Sales to the state of New York||||1||
Z||000000||Rodney||09-17-2001||11:47 PM||||Here is an interesting observation:<P>Pennsylvania and Illinois are my biggest states for<BR>sales. I have sold to most states but IL and PA are the<BR>usual leaders. New York state is certainly not a big<BR>state for parts sales. I do send parts there<BR>occasionally but not a whole lot. In the last week I<BR>have sent several orders to the state of New York. You<BR>would think the recent happenings would have kept New<BR>York people from thinking about their Fieros. I guess<BR>not.  : )<P>Thanks,<BR>Rodney Dickman<BR>New web page! <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rodneydickman.com</A> <P><BR>||||reg||1
