Z||000005||Doni Hagan||09-18-2001||12:41 PM||||My wife's from NYC (Greenwich Village area)and we've had two very tense nights tracking down family members and friends (two of the friends are still unaccounted for.) She refuses to watch the news reports and tightens up every time the phone rings. <P>She's been at the health club every day for 3-4 hours wherein she usually goes 2-3 times a week. Her reasoning is it's a mindless activity and she can focus on something else for a while. <P>Humans are very complex lifeforms.     ||||reg||1
Z||000006||k2m4||09-20-2001||04:03 PM||||Hey rodney I live in New york and to top it off i work for the Governer. Let me tell you my fiero is my only escape from all the shenanigans that are going on. I have seen ground zero with mine own 2 eyes and let me tell you to come home to my fiero that will let me just drive  the Adirondaks and forget makes me really appreciate the simple pleasures in life (my fiero). i have 2 junk yards near me that i rape for parts when ever i need them so as far as ordering parts i only do when necessary. We are alive and strong up here!<P>kerm<BR>86 GT<BR>86 2M4||||reg||1
